entityDescription:
Wing is a group of companies that has been active for over 15 years in the field of engineering sciences, by developing and implementing innovative products and services.
Market leader in the field of RDI through the projects won and implemented, as well as through the consulting services offered in this field.
More than 50 RDI projects developed in the framework of National Programs, FP7 and H2020 Programs;

Objectives:
• Development of innovative products, services and technologies;
• Development of innovative products, services and technologies in RDI projects;
• Transfer of technologies in the priority areas of research of Romania and the European Union;
• To capitalize the results obtained and introduce them on the market;
• Continuous improvement through investment in people and education;

Development directions:
• Development of innovative products, services and technologies in the fields of IT&C, space and security, electrical engineering and energy; aerospace engineering and medical engineering;
• Management of RDI projects carried out with European funds and providing scientific and technical support;
• Research and development activities - innovation in IT&C, space and security, electrical and energy engineering;

